-- Product copy from the master Product details sheet (26 Nov 2026). Run ONLY after you have reviewed the sheet. Supabase -> SQL editor.
-- Sets the one-line description, the scent story and the scent notes (top, heart, base) for the products that have drafted copy.
-- It overwrites those three fields only. It does NOT touch prices, stock, photos, orders, settings or any other detail.
begin;
